    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78601" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρα-πλήξ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῆγος</span>,
			ὁ, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stricken sideways</i> or
				<i>aslant</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠϊόνες π</span>. a
				<i>retreating</i> beach, on which the waves <i>break
				obliquely</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				5.418
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph., 
				=
